&lt;li&gt;Annual bonus scheme dependent on individual and company performance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday each year (+ bank holidays + 1 day after each year of service with up to a max. of 30 days)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workplace pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance (upon 30 days of employment)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7 hours per day, 35 hours per week&lt;/li&gt;
